{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13309030","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13309030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1330903001:1":{"text":"난처하게 만들 생각은 없지만, 제대로 된 이유를 대야 할 거다. 왜 내가 대공에게 가지 못하게 막은 거지?","source_cn":"我无意为难你，但你必须给我一个合理的理由。告诉我，为何...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BC1F75A99031CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1330903002:1":{"text":"...죄송합니다, 자작님. 황실의 명령입니다.","source_cn":"……很抱歉，子爵大人，这是来自帝国皇庭的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0452818BAC9E72A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1330903003:1":{"text":"뭐? 황실이라고? 듀라 님이시여! 대체 무슨 일이 벌어지는 건지...","source_cn":"什么？皇庭？！艾雅在上，到底发生了什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF94FEF20E9F5087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1330903004:1":{"text":"용서하십시오. 저는... 아무것도 말할 수 없습니다. 자작님의 안전을 위해 물러나 주십시오.","source_cn":"请您原谅，我……我不能说。为了您的安全，还请您先离开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FDE06ECCF768EE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:扎瓦茨基子爵":{"text":"자바츠키 자작","source":"扎瓦茨基子爵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卫兵卡鲁":{"text":"경비병 커류","source":"卫兵卡鲁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}